    "Fix `z` and suppose `f z ≠ 0`."
    "Continuity makes the reflected factor `f (-w)` nonzero on a neighbourhood of `-z`."
    "On that neighbourhood, the zero-product identity therefore forces `f w = 0`."
    "Package differentiability as `AnalyticOnNhd` and propagate the local equality with zero across the preconnected disk using the analytic identity principle."]
